<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Moody's to review Victoria, W.A. housing bonds.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Moody's to review Victoria, W.A. housing bonds.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday it had placed on review for possible upgrade the Aa2 rating on the A$734.8 million of bonds issued by Victorian Housing Bonds Ltd and the Aa1 rating on the A$728.0 million of bonds issued by Keystart Bonds Ltd, based in Western Australia.</p>
<p>The action follows the review of each state's domestic currency rating announced earlier on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
